Configure Colony as an MCP stdio server in your agent’s config:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "colony": {
      "command": "colony",
      "args": ["--home", "/absolute/path/to/agent-home", "mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

Use an absolute executable path if `colony` isn’t on `PATH`. [README.md:70](README.md#L70)

